前不久或怀孕时第一次感染弓形虫，会传给胎儿。多数被感染的孩子出生时没有症状，长大后可能失明或智力残疾。少数孩子出生时就有严重的眼睛或脑损伤。英国国家医疗服务体系（NHS）说，孕期感染可能导致流产。法国里昂的弓形虫检测中心统计了 603 名孕期确诊感染的孕妇，多数用了抗寄生虫药。传给胎儿的总比例是 29%（95% CI 25 至 33，可信范围）。孕 13 周感染的约 6% 传给胎儿，孕 36 周感染的约 72%。越早感染，孩子越容易出症状。孕 24 到 30 周感染的，孩子早早出现症状的风险最高，约 10%。欧洲六个城市比较了孕期新感染和没感染的孕妇。家里养猫 OR 1.0（95% CI 0.7 至 1.5），没有差别。自己清猫砂盆 OR 1.3（95% CI 0.8 至 2.1），差别可能只是偶然。吃没熟透的羊肉 OR 3.13（95% CI 1.4 至 7.2），风险约是不吃的 3 倍。碰土 OR 1.81（95% CI 1.2 至 2.7），高约八成。各城市有 30% 到 63% 的感染能算到没熟透或腌制的肉上，6% 到 17% 算到碰土上。美国疾病控制与预防中心给孕妇的做法：能让别人换猫砂就让别人换。没人换就戴一次性手套，换完用肥皂和水洗手。猫砂每天换，因为猫粪里的弓形虫要过 1 到 5 天才会传染人。孕期别新养猫，别收养或摸流浪猫，尤其是小猫。猫关在屋里，只喂猫粮或做熟的食物，不喂生肉。中国疾控中心的科普也说，准爸爸尽量承担清理猫砂盆，孕期做好防护可以把猫留在身边。NHS 写明，摸猫、养猫都不会染上弓形虫"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原始出处"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Centers for Disease Control and Prevention. Toxoplasmosis: Risk Factors. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.cdc.gov/toxoplasmosis/risk-factors/index.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.cdc.gov/toxoplasmosis/risk-factors/index.html"]},"；Centers for Disease Control and Prevention. Preventing Toxoplasmosis. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.cdc.gov/toxoplasmosis/prevention/index.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.cdc.gov/toxoplasmosis/prevention/index.html"]},"；NHS. Toxoplasmosis. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.nhs.uk/conditions/toxoplasmosis/","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.nhs.uk/conditions/toxoplasmosis/"]},"；中国疾病预防控制中心 (2025). 孕期弓形虫感染，都是「吸猫」惹的祸吗？ ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.chinacdc.cn/jkkp/crb/qtcr/202501/t20250103_303681.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.chinacdc.cn/jkkp/crb/qtcr/202501/t20250103_303681.html"]},"；Cook AJ, Gilbert RE, Buffolano W, et al. (2000). Sources of toxoplasma infection in pregnant women: European multicentre case-control study. BMJ, 321(7254), 142-147. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1136/bmj.321.7254.142","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1136/bmj.321.7254.142"]},"；Dunn D, Wallon M, Peyron F, Petersen E, Peckham C, Gilbert R (1999). Mother-to-child transmission of toxoplasmosis: risk estimates for clinical counselling. Lancet, 353(9167), 1829-1833. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1016/s0140-6736(98)08220-8","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1016/s0140-6736(98)08220-8"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.cdc.gov/toxoplasmosis/risk-factors/index.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["打开来源链接"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["猫一般只在第一次感染后的几周里随粪便排出弓形虫。以前感染过的成年猫，再排出的可能更小。猫关在屋里、不吃生肉，被感染的机会也小。家里不养猫也照样会染上，来源是没熟透的肉、没洗净的蔬果、被猫粪污染的土和生水。所以要做的是这几样：肉做到全熟，切过生肉的刀、案板和手要洗；蔬果用流水冲洗；种花、翻土戴手套，事后洗手。NHS 还提醒别吃萨拉米、帕尔马火腿这类生腌肉，别喝没消毒的羊奶。那项欧洲研究没细问生菜和没洗的蔬菜，14% 到 49% 的感染找不到来源。要不要查弓形虫抗体，问产检医生。定 B 是因为猫和肉的风险只有一项研究的数字，而且是事后回忆的。做法来自官方机构，没有研究算过照做能少多少感染。收益定「中」凭判断，理由在核实记录里。好处落在你自己和孩子身上"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/27-16"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"产后 42 天那次复查别跳过，它同时是产后抑郁的筛查"]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/27-10"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["没有医学指征就别主动要求剖宫产，也别为了挑日子开刀"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["世界卫生组织的说法是，一个地方的剖宫产比例超过 10% 以后，母亲和新生儿的死亡就不再继续下降。该剖的一定要剖。为了挑日子、怕疼去剖，只是…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/27-11"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["怀孕前就确认生育保险的参保状态，未就业的配偶也能报生育医疗费用"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["单位交了生育保险，生孩子的医疗费和产假期间的津贴都从这笔基金里出。配偶没工作的，医疗费这一块也能报。参保月数够不够、在外地生要不要先备案，…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/27-12"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["出院前把《出生医学证明》办掉，名字提前想好、别写错字"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["这张证是上户口、参保、上学的前置件，而且只有接生的那家机构能第一次开。出了院再回头补，要另走一套流程、多交材料。名字里的字，先确认户籍系统…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/27-13"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["新生儿足跟血筛查和听力筛查都别拒绝"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["扎一次足跟血、做一次听力测试，能在孩子看起来完全正常的时候，查出甲减、苯丙酮尿症和听力障碍。等症状显出来，智力上的损害已经补不回来了。"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/27-14"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["拿到出生医学证明就给孩子办居民医保，别等落完户"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["拿到出生证就能在网上给孩子参保，不用等落户。参上了，出院时的住院费当场就能报。新生儿的住院费不低，参保和没参保差别很大。"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/27-15"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["孩子出生后一个月以内去派出所申报出生登记"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["法律给的是一个月，不是「有空再说」。落户卡着后面的打疫苗、入园、入学和办身份证。越往后拖，要补的材料越多。"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/27"},"children":["阅读整个主题：怀孕和生产：从发现怀孕到出院办证"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-ad-space life-ad-space-sponsored","data-ad-placement":"ad_footer","data-ad-group":"reading","data-ad-creative":"read_product","data-ad-ready":"false","aria-label":"广告 · 社区推荐"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-brand"},"children":[{"tag":"img","props":{"src":"/sites/howtolivebetter/images/shengcai/logo.png","width":"565","height":"144","alt":"生财有术官方 Logo","decoding":"async"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-copy"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-label"},"children":["广告 · 社区推荐"]},{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["读过的知识，能不能做成有用的产品？"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["从电子书、资料到小工具，看看圈友怎样发现需求，把内容变成实际交付。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-actions"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-link","href":"/shengcaiyoushu?sc_group=reading&sc_creative=read_product&s